  "design": {
    "identity": "Heavy ancient balance-machine knight, oxidized cold steel and verdigris brass armor, exposed shoulder gears, ivory measurement scale marks, black-purple cloth, exactly two large mechanical boots, right forearm heavy cleaver, left forearm furnace nozzle with small orange core.",
    "attack": "Brace boots, lower hips, raise cleaver far overhead then full-body powerful LEFT heavy cleave, gears rotate and recover.",
    "cast": "Crouch as furnace loads, spread shoulders and open left nozzle, torso leans massively LEFT, vent a long orange-white flamethrower cone; valve shuts and return.",
    "death": "Gears jam, furnace goes dark, chassis drops to knee then heavy forward-side collapse, cleaver and nozzle remain attached."
  },
